  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "mof-datasets",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMixture of Frames (MoF) \u2014 datasets\n\t\n\nThis repository contains the demonstration datasets to reproduce the simulation results of the paper Mixture of Frames Policy: Multi-Frame Action Denoising for Bimanual Mobile Manipulation.\nProject Page | GitHub Code\nDemonstration datasets to reproduce the simulation results of the MoF paper\n(BiGym RBY1 + DexMimicGen, 9 tasks). RGB + low-dim observations only (depth and\npoint-cloud channels, unused by the released image policies, are removed).\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dian-wang/mof-datasets.",
  "alternateName": [
    "dian-wang/mof-datasets",
    "Mixture of Frames (MoF) \u2014 datasets"
  ],
